{"id":"00923","root":"uni00923_1","name":{"ja":"クリア","en":"Clear"},"title":{"ja":"【バジリスク】","en":"【Basilik】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【バジリスク】 クリア","en":"【Basilik】 Clear"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2025-07-31","limited":true,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"魔のものに対抗するため、科学の粋を集めて強化された存在。\nタイプヒーローというコードネームで呼ばれていた。\n特別兵装として、シンイとカムイという装備を持つ。\nシンイは特殊な粒子により作られたブレード、カムイは常時展開可能なシールドである。\n兵装の負荷に耐えられるよう遺伝子操作も行われており、常人の数倍の身体能力を誇る。\n感情表現には乏しく、常に冷静、人に仇なす存在を駆逐するマシーンと化していたが、時折子供っぽい動作や仕草をみせることがあり、それが本来の性格であると伺い知ることができる。\n現在は水城家の居候として幸せに暮らしている。","en":"They are an existence enhanced with the essence of science to counter demonic forces. They were known by the codename Type Hero. They possess special equipment, Shin'i and Kamui. Shin'i is a blade made from special particles, and Kamui is a shield that can be deployed at any time. They have undergone genetic modification to withstand the load of their equipment, boasting physical abilities several times that of a normal person. They are often calm and lack emotional expression, having become a machine dedicated to eliminating forces that harm people. However, they occasionally display childish actions and behaviors, which may be a glimpse into their true personality. Currently, they live with the Mizuki family, where they are happy."},"illustrator":"スースー","voiceActor":"梅原亜衣","forms":[{"id":"uni00923_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[195,390],"def":[126,252],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","2530115"]},{"id":"uni00923_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[325,650],"def":[187,374],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","2530115","2530116"]},{"id":"uni00923_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2018,4036],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[460,920],"def":[253,506],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills"